        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s2_sub_008_doku_05",
      "hash64": "20C019EA316F2600",
      "text": "這股常人無法散發的氣息若是來自\\n[VAR 0x0100(0000)]閣下，便不意外了。[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s2_sub_008_fairy_03",
      "hash64": "BB429C3E873D6720",
      "text": "不不，這是怎麼一回事啊？\\n為什麼[VAR 0x0100(0000)]會在這裡～？[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s2_sub_008_aku_06",
      "hash64": "4368CA59C8652149",
      "text": "好消息！[VAR 0x0100(0000)][VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]他她……\\n不對！[VAR 0x0100(0000)]老師[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]他她……\\r\\n是來教大家功課的喔！[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
