    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s2_sub_008_doku_06",
      "hash64": "20C01CEA316F2B19",
      "text": "哦哦，在下感激不盡！\\n實在不勝感激！[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 18,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0023"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s2_sub_008_fairy_04",
      "hash64": "BB42A33E873D7305",
      "text": "啥～！？我可沒聽說這件事！[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s2_sub_008_fairy_05",
      "hash64": "BB42A23E873D7152",
      "text": "話說回來，皮拿！\\n你不要擅自決定！[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0020"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s2_sub_008_fairy_06",
      "hash64": "BB42A13E873D6F9F",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳也是！我才不需要\\n什麼老師，快回去！[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
