          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 40,
      "label": "s2_sub_008_aku_10",
      "hash64": "43654659C8620B26",
      "text": "能提高專注力的ＢＧＭ……\\n再怎麼說萊姆的曲子還是不適合吧。[VAR 0x0114(0021)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0021"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 41,
      "label": "s2_sub_008_kakutou_13",
      "hash64": "0C96325883EACA16",
      "text": "最近梅洛一直在讀書，\\n所以說不定她是去活動一下身體？[VAR 0x0114(0022)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0022"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 42,
      "label": "s2_sub_008_fairy_10",
      "hash64": "BB3F193E873A52B0",
      "text": "[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳來當老師，\\n也就是說[VAR 0x1100(00FF,0101)]你妳連成績都很好？\\r\\n樣樣精通，真讓我不爽。[VAR 0x0114(0020)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1100",
          "args_hex": [
            "00FF",
            "0101"
          ]
