    {
      "ordinal": 43,
      "label": "s2_sub_008_doku_09",
      "hash64": "20C025EA316F3A64",
      "text": "學問之道錯綜複雜宛如迷宮，\\n懇請多多鞭策，多多指教。[VAR 0x0114(0023)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
